    "detailed_description": "Play through multiple levels and shred through hundreds of enemies in this ALL NEW ACTION PACKED ROGUELIKE. Use Thousands of weapon and upgrade combinations to create your own strategy to progress through the ever-challenging stages of progression. Permanent upgrades and multiple classes allow for many different starting points and tons of replay-ability.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971130/extras/8398bbe922a4553fc3c36f5fe9c329db.poster.avif?t=1725828481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971130/extras/8398bbe922a4553fc3c36f5fe9c329db.webm?t=1725828481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971130/extras/8398bbe922a4553fc3c36f5fe9c329db.mp4?t=1725828481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Craft a strategy using up to 6 Weapons, destroying everything in your path and crown yourself the KING of the apocalypse.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971130/extras/67bc01d4fddd4582ad46b6f2eb2dd577.poster.avif?t=1725828481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971130/extras/67bc01d4fddd4582ad46b6f2eb2dd577.webm?t=1725828481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971130/extras/67bc01d4fddd4582ad46b6f2eb2dd577.mp4?t=1725828481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Add passives to your kit to add abilities to all of your weapons, create a shockwave around every critical hit, increase running speed depending on your level, and even heal for every enemy killed. All abilities, skills, upgrades, and weapons scale with one another, creating an experience that any player can succeed with any preferred strategy, if you play well of course ;)",
    "about_the_game": "Play through multiple levels and shred through hundreds of enemies in this ALL NEW ACTION PACKED ROGUELIKE. Use Thousands of weapon and upgrade combinations to create your own strategy to progress through the ever-challenging stages of progression. Permanent upgrades and multiple classes allow for many different starting points and tons of replay-ability.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971130/extras/8398bbe922a4553fc3c36f5fe9c329db.poster.avif?t=1725828481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971130/extras/8398bbe922a4553fc3c36f5fe9c329db.webm?t=1725828481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971130/extras/8398bbe922a4553fc3c36f5fe9c329db.mp4?t=1725828481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Craft a strategy using up to 6 Weapons, destroying everything in your path and crown yourself the KING of the apocalypse.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971130/extras/67bc01d4fddd4582ad46b6f2eb2dd577.poster.avif?t=1725828481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971130/extras/67bc01d4fddd4582ad46b6f2eb2dd577.webm?t=1725828481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971130/extras/67bc01d4fddd4582ad46b6f2eb2dd577.mp4?t=1725828481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Add passives to your kit to add abilities to all of your weapons, create a shockwave around every critical hit, increase running speed depending on your level, and even heal for every enemy killed. All abilities, skills, upgrades, and weapons scale with one another, creating an experience that any player can succeed with any preferred strategy, if you play well of course ;)",
    "short_description": "Cataclysm Survivors is an action packed roguelike in the survivors genre. With countless weapons and upgrades, play through endless waves of zombies and become INFINITELY POWERFUL. Thousands of Weapon and Upgrade combinations and TONS of enemies to slaughter with multiple classes and maps.",
